*> type (1 literal, 2 argument), executable (1 where a usage string may end), the name, and for an
*> argument node the parser (05a id: 2 brigadier:double, 3 brigadier:integer, 5 brigadier:string, 7
*> game_profile), the string kind (0 single word, 2 greedy phrase), the minimum and maximum of a
*> number range (both always present: range flags 0x03), and 1 when it has ask_server suggestions.
